 "strings": [
  "",
  "North American Command",
  "Char",
  "\"Still holding out, are they?",
  " Well, Garma's bound to struggle.\"",
  "\"He's proving for us why",
  " we failed more than once",
  " to seize the secret weapon.\"",
  "\"And against more than we had.\"",
  "Dren",
  "\"Sir?\"",
  "\"General Dozle, too, will see",
  " that it was never a lack",
  " of ability on my part.\"",
  "\"I see.\"",
  "\"Has Garma",
  " sortied in a mobile suit?\"",
  "\"No, sir.\"",
  "(I see.",
  " So Garma didn't get in one.)",
  "(If he died fighting the white one,",
  " fine; if I stepped in to save him",
  " in a pinch, also fine--I thought.)"
 ]
